## Sale Transaction

```kotlin
val client = TaplinkSDK.getClient()

val request = SaleRequest.builder()
    .setReferenceOrderId("ORDER_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")      // Required, 6–32 chars
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")    // Required, must be unique
    .setAmount(AmountInfo(BigDecimal("1000"), "USD"))                 // Required
    .setPaymentMethod(PaymentMethodInfo(PaymentCategory.CARD))       // Recommended for card
    .setCardNetworkType(CardNetworkType.CREDIT)                      // Optional: CREDIT or DEBIT
    .setDescription("Product Purchase")                              // Optional, max 128 chars
    .setPrintReceipt(PrintReceipt.AUTO)                              // Optional, default: AUTO
    .build()

client.sale(request, callback)
```

### On-Screen Tip during Sale:

```kotlin
val amount = AmountInfo(
    orderAmount = BigDecimal("1000"),
    pricingCurrency = "USD",
    tipConfig = TipConfig(
        onScreenTip = true,
        tipMode = TipMode.ON_SALE,
        tipWithTax = false,
        suggestions = TipSuggestions(
            feeMode = FeeMode.RATE,
            values = listOf(15, 18, 20)   // 15%, 18%, 20%
        )
    )
    // tipAmount must be null when tipConfig is set
)
```

