## Refund Transaction

### Referenced Refund (with original transaction ID):
```kotlin
val request = RefundRequest.referencedBuilder()
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")   // Required, unique
    .setOriginalTransactionId("original_txn_id")                    // Required
    .setAmount(AmountInfo(BigDecimal("500"), "USD"))                 // Required: refund amount
    .setPaymentMethod(PaymentMethodInfo(PaymentCategory.CARD))
    .setDescription("Product Return")
    .build()

client.refund(request, callback)
```

### Non-Referenced Refund (requires card swipe):
```kotlin
val request = RefundRequest.nonReferencedBuilder()
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
    .setReferenceOrderId("REFUND_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")     // Required for non-referenced
    .setAmount(AmountInfo(BigDecimal("500"), "USD"))
    .setPaymentMethod(PaymentMethodInfo(PaymentCategory.CARD))
    .build()

client.refund(request, callback)
```

