## Void Transaction

Cancels a **same-day** transaction (no online authorization, faster than refund).  
For cross-day transactions, use `Refund` instead.

```kotlin
val request = VoidRequest.builder()
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
    .setOriginalTransactionId("original_txn_id")   // Required
    .setDescription("Cancel Transaction")
    .build()

client.void(request, callback)
```

