## Authorization (Pre-Auth)

Freeze funds without charging — used for hotels, car rentals, etc.

```kotlin
val authAmount = AuthAmountInfo(
    authAmount = BigDecimal("5000"),   // Estimated amount to freeze
    pricingCurrency = "USD"
)

val request = AuthRequest.builder()
    .setReferenceOrderId("AUTH_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
    .setAmount(authAmount)
    .setDescription("Hotel Reservation")
    .build()

client.auth(request, callback)
```

---

## Post-Authorization (Pre-Auth Completion)

Completes a pre-auth and performs the actual charge.

```kotlin
val request = PostAuthRequest.builder()
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
    .setOriginalTransactionId("original_auth_txn_id")   // Required
    .setAmount(AmountInfo(BigDecimal("4500"), "USD"))    // Final charge amount
    .setDescription("Complete Hotel Payment")
    .build()

client.postAuth(request, callback)
```

---

## Incremental Authorization

Increases an existing pre-auth amount.

```kotlin
val request = IncrementalAuthRequest.builder()
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
    .setOriginalTransactionId("original_auth_txn_id")
    .setAmount(AmountInfo(BigDecimal("1000"), "USD"))    // Additional amount to add
    .build()

client.incrementalAuth(request, callback)
```

---

## Tip Adjustment

Adjusts the tip on an existing sale transaction.

```kotlin
val request = TipAdjustRequest.builder()
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
    .setOriginalTransactionId("original_sale_txn_id")
    .setTipAmount(BigDecimal("200"))   // New tip amount (smallest unit)
    .build()

client.tipAdjust(request, callback)
```

---

## Abort Transaction

Cancels an in-progress transaction.

```kotlin
val request = AbortRequest.builder()
    .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
    .build()

client.abort(request, callback)
```

